=== Решение задачи 7.5

Для $A = mat(1, 3; 2, 2)$:
+ $p( lambda ) =  lambda ^2 - 3 lambda  + (2 - 6) =  lambda ^2 - 3 lambda  - 4 = ( lambda  - 4)( lambda  + 1) = 0$.  
   $ lambda _1 = 4,  lambda _2 = -1$.
+ Векторы:
   - $ lambda _1 = 4$: $mat(-3, 3; 2, -2) v = bold(0)  =>  x = y  =>  v_1 = mat(1; 1)$.
   - $ lambda _2 = -1$: $mat(2, 3; 2, 3) v = bold(0)  =>  2x + 3y = 0  =>  v_2 = mat(-3; 2)$.
+ Матрица $P = mat(1, -3; 1, 2)$, $ det  P = 2 - (-3) = 5$.  
   $P^(-1) = ((1) / (5)) mat(2, 3; -1, 1)$.
+ Вычислим $A^(10) = P D^(10) P^(-1)$:



$ D^(10) = mat(4^(10), 0; 0, (-1)^(10)) = mat(1 048 576, 0; 0, 1) $






$ A^(10) = ((1) / (5)) mat(1, -3; 1, 2) mat(4^(10), 0; 0, 1) mat(2, 3; -1, 1) = ((1) / (5)) mat(2  dot  4^(10) + 3, 3  dot  4^(10) - 3; 2  dot  4^(10) - 2, 3  dot  4^(10) + 2) $




