=== Решение задачи 7.7

Для $A = mat(1, 2; 3, 4)$:
+ $p( lambda ) =  lambda ^2 - 5 lambda  - 2$.
+ Проверим $p(A) = A^2 - 5A - 2I$:



$ A^2 = mat(1, 2; 3, 4) mat(1, 2; 3, 4) = mat(7, 10; 15, 22) $






$ 5A + 2I = mat(5, 10; 15, 20) + mat(2, 0; 0, 2) = mat(7, 10; 15, 22) = A^2  =>  A^2 - 5A - 2I = O $



+ Выражения:
   - $A^2 - 5A = 2I  =>  A(A - 5I) = 2I  =>  A^(-1) = ((1) / (2))(A - 5I) = ((1) / (2)) A - ((5) / (2)) I$.
   - $A^3 = A  dot  A^2 = A(5A + 2I) = 5A^2 + 2A = 5(5A + 2I) + 2A = 27A + 10I$.

